// ===========================================================================
// OBJECT:       obj_pen_pig
// EVENT:        Create
// REVISION:     1.0.0
// SYSTEM:       Pen Pig Object
// ARCHITECTURE: Object Event Architecture
//
// DESCRIPTION:
// Configures the pen to accept pigs by setting accepted_animal = ANIMAL.PIG after inherited setup.
//
